    "title": "DTG hyperglycemia risk assessment needed",
    "message": "Guidelines report hyperglycemia among previously non-diabetic adults on DTG and recommend screening clients with 2 or more risk factors. This patient is 29 years old with no family history of diabetes mentioned, no hypertension, and BMI approximately 25.3 kg/m² (68 kg, estimated height not provided). She has fewer than 2 established risk factors. However, pregnancy itself can impair glucose tolerance and the guidelines list BMI ≥25 as a risk factor. No blood glucose has been checked since initiating DTG. A random blood sugar or fasting glucose should be considered given the pregnancy context.",
