    "title": "No clinician assessment or plan documented",
    "message": "The clinician's assessment and plan section is blank for this visit. Guidelines require structured monitoring for TDF patients including serum creatinine and eGFR, and symptom screening using a screening tool. This patient has a rising creatinine trend and is pregnant, making a documented plan essential. Key missing elements include renal function follow-up, DTG hyperglycemia screening consideration, and maternal-fetal monitoring plan. The viral load of 89 copies/mL is not fully suppressed, which also warrants a documented management approach.",
